From cae52dd7b9a4cebd165fc187c3cc07f65cf17320 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:50:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] SystemUI: Keep the desktop shade window untouchable over
 Gone

On the desktop status bar, a pinned heads-up with no shade overlay open
made the whole screen below the status bar touchable, so the shade
window swallowed every tap meant for apps and overlays until the
heads-up went away. Over Gone, only an open overlay and the heads-up
itself take touches now.
